WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.990
Kɔm bot te H R officer training fɔ SaloneHCM.

2
00:00:02.990 --> 00:00:09.385
In wok de kip ɛni rɛkɔd kɔrɛkt — ɛn kɔrɛkt rɛkɔd dɛn na dɛn de mek payroll, kɔmplɛyans, ɛn audit dɛn izi.

3
00:00:09.385 --> 00:00:14.074
Wi go kɔva di ɛmplɔyi rɛjista, liv manejmɛnt, atɛndans, ɛn di dɔkyumɛnt vɔlt.

4
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.894
Di ɛmplɔyi rɛjista na in singl sɔs fɔ trut.

5
00:00:17.894 --> 00:00:22.752
Ɛni pɔsin in gred, salari, bank ditels, NASSIT nɔmba, ɛn dipatmɛnt de insay ya.

6
00:00:22.752 --> 00:00:32.530
Yuz di sɔch bar fɔ fɛn ɛnibɔdi kwik-kwik, ɛn di ad ɛmplɔyi bɔtin fɔ onbɔd nyu pɔsin — di fɔm go gɛd yu trowe ɛni rikwayd fild,inklud statutory aydɛntifaya dɛn.

7
00:00:33.250 --> 00:00:39.905
Nɛks, liv. Ɛmplɔyi dɛn de rikwɛst liv frɔm dɛn self-service pɔtal, ɛn dɛn rikwɛst dɛn de kam ya fɔ in apruvul.

8
00:00:39.905 --> 00:00:46.258
Yu go si balans dɛn, ɔvalap det dɛn, ɛn di tim kalɛnda bifo yu disayd — so kɔva gap dɛn nɔ go sɔprayz yu.

9
00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:55.006
Atɛndans de gi yu di deli pikchɔ: usay klɔk in, usay absɛnt, ɛn di taymshit totul dɛn we de fid insay payroll.

10
00:00:55.006 --> 00:01:00.226
Rɛkɔd dɛn go fit kɔrɛkt bay H R we divays pwɛl — ɛn ɛni kɔrɛkshɔn de insay audit log.

11
00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:10.847
Las, di dɔkyumɛnt vɔlt. Kɔntrakt dɛn, aydɛntiti dɔkyumɛnt dɛn, disiplɛnari lɛta dɛn — ɔplod wɔn tɛm, kip ɛn sikiur insay di klɔwd, ɛn skop to in ɔganayzeshɔn.

12
00:01:10.847 --> 00:01:14.978
Yuz di sɔch ɛn katɛgori filta dɛn fɔ ritriv ɛnitin insay sɛkɔnd dɛn.

13
00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:20.218
Mɛmba: klin ɛmplɔyi deta tide de privɛnt payroll dispyut tumara.

14
00:01:20.218 --> 00:01:25.178
We yu rɛdi, tek di H R officer quiz insay di Training Center ɛn ɔn in sɛtifiket.
